.TH LIBMPQ__UPDATE_ABORT 3 2026-09-25 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__update_abort \- discard a staged MPQ update
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__update_abort(mpq_update_s *update);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Discards the private working copy and leaves the original destination unchanged. Cleanup is attempted even if one step fails. The handle is consumed regardless of the result; do not use it again.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP on success, or a negative libmpq error.
.SH ERRORS
Cleanup or close failures return a negative LIBMPQ_ERROR_* value.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__update_begin (3),
.BR libmpq__update_commit (3)
